r-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d8e3c9f\" data-eae-slider=\"35808\" data-id=\"d8e3c9f\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cec0de9 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-gva-heading-block\" data-id=\"cec0de9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"gva-heading-block.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gva-element-gva-heading-block gva-element\">   <div class=\"align-left style-1 widget gsc-heading box-align-left auto-responsive\">\r\n      <div class=\"content-inner\">\r\n         \r\n                  \r\n           \r\n         \r\n                     <h2 class=\"title\">\r\n               <span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">Details<\/span><\/span>\r\n            <\/h2>\r\n                  \r\n         \r\n      <\/div>\r\n   <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-45160c1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default row-top\" data-eae-slider=\"80265\" data-id=\"45160c1\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-b579d77\" data-eae-slider=\"77287\" data-id=\"b579d77\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a7f5f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6a7f5f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"415\">Waytransit Travels & Tourism proudly participated in the <strong data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"278\">4th American Wellness Center Annual Conference 2025<\/strong>, an inspiring gathering where global leaders and innovators came together to redefine the future of <strong data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"412\">health and wellness in travel<\/strong>.<\/p><p data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"679\">At the conference, our team explored how <strong data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"488\">mindful travel experiences<\/strong> can nurture both the body and soul \u2014 from <strong data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"581\">wellness retreats and rejuvenating spa escapes<\/strong> to <strong data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"627\">holistic, health-conscious itineraries<\/strong> that prioritize mental well-being and relaxation.<\/p><p data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"993\">The event featured <strong data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"732\">insightful panel discussions<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"758\">interactive sessions<\/strong>, and <strong data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"793\">meaningful collaborations<\/strong> with wellness experts and industry pioneers. Each exchange reinforced our belief that travel is not just about destinations \u2014 it\u2019s about creating journeys that restore balance, peace, and vitality.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a2e777a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a2e777a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>As Waytransit Travels & Tourism continues to evolve, we remain dedicated to crafting travel experiences that <strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1136\">promote wellness, mindfulness, and happiness<\/strong> at every step of the journey.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0bf9447\" data-eae-slider=\"15826\" data-id=\"0bf9447\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7dacbdc elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7dacbdc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"642\" height=\"720\" src=\"https:\/\/waytransittourism.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/pr-event.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-8415\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-bf5913e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default row-top\" data-eae-slider=\"69567\" data-id=\"bf5913e\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-32a04de\" data-eae-slider=\"75893\" data-id=\"32a04de\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div cl